00:18:26,560 --> 00:18:28,580
I said wait, not keep going!

264
00:18:30,380 --> 00:18:31,210
Robin!

265
00:18:31,293 --> 00:18:32,200
There you are!

266
00:18:32,500 --> 00:18:33,794
We're in deep trouble.

267
00:18:33,940 --> 00:18:36,760
I'm so happy! Are you okay? Say something!

268
00:18:37,060 --> 00:18:38,700
Why are you doing this?

269
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,177
I went through all that trouble
to sneak in from the outside!

270
00:18:41,260 --> 00:18:43,789
I even took out that
Snoopy government guy!

271
00:18:44,900 --> 00:18:46,720
So that's Nico Robin, huh?

272
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:48,190
I'd buy that.

273
00:18:48,300 --> 00:18:51,712
Looks like the girl in the
wanted poster, that's for sure.

274
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:56,617
Let me knock these guys
out, then we'll escape!

275
00:18:56,700 --> 00:19:00,171
We'll run away together and
leave all this behind us, okay?

276
00:19:00,740 --> 00:19:02,152
It's gonna be all right!

277
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:27,200
It seems that my words
mean nothing to you people

278
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:33,200
Ha, ha, ha!

279
00:19:36,420 --> 00:19:37,340
Franky, quick!

280
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:41,780
Detach the third car! Uh-uh! Why?

281
00:19:41,880 --> 00:19:43,540
What are we gonna do? Run!

282
00:19:43,940 --> 00:19:44,881
We're gonna run?

283
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:46,737
What the heck are you talking about?

284
00:19:46,820 --> 00:19:48,520
You too, Sanji. Get ready.

285
00:19:48,680 --> 00:19:50,217
This will all be over in a flash.

286
00:19:50,300 --> 00:19:52,535
Make sure that Franky doesn't escape.

287
00:19:52,700 --> 00:19:53,530
Right!

288
00:19:56,180 --> 00:19:57,220
Sniper Kong!

289
00:19:59,500 --> 00:20:00,330
Smokestorm!

290
00:20:05,620 --> 00:20:07,960
What kind of a stupid stunt is that?

291
00:20:09,860 --> 00:20:10,800
Come on!

292
00:20:14,580 --> 00:20:16,600
I've got her! Move it!

293
00:20:20,500 --> 00:20:22,760
Put me down! Let go!

294
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,100
All right!

295
00:20:27,780 --> 00:20:28,610
Run!

296
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:34,450
Whoa!

297
00:20:34,720 --> 00:20:35,940
Turn back!

298
00:20:41,460 --> 00:20:43,400
But we've already come so far!

299
00:20:43,620 --> 00:20:44,760
Venture us!

300
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:46,200
Yeah, tell us why!

301
00:20:46,320 --> 00:20:47,967
You better give us a reason!

302
00:20:48,060 --> 00:20:49,940
That's not what I meant!

303
00:20:50,760 --> 00:20:51,590
Huh?

304
00:20:51,780 --> 00:20:56,320
I was telling that giant frog that
jumped on the real way to turn back!

305
00:20:56,580 --> 00:20:58,080
He came out a new way!

306
00:20:59,980 --> 00:21:00,980
Get him, get him!

307
00:21:02,060 --> 00:21:04,700
Yokozuna? Go away! Look out!

308
00:21:04,920 --> 00:21:06,626
A giant rock's on the tracks!

309
00:21:07,660 --> 00:21:08,490
Rocky!

310
00:21:08,573 --> 00:21:09,403
Turn back!

311
00:21:09,486 --> 00:21:11,120
Get out of the way! Shut up!

312
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:13,160
Look out!

313
00:21:20,540 --> 00:21:21,370
Yes!

314
00:21:21,453 --> 00:21:22,460
We did it!

315
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:25,100
We got Robin back! You know,

316
00:21:25,320 --> 00:21:29,377
I should be happy, but I'm not really
a big fan of this running away stuff.

317
00:21:29,460 --> 00:21:33,695
That smokescreen was such a stupid
idea that it actually surprised them.

318
00:21:35,440 --> 00:21:36,600
Sniper King says,

319
00:21:37,160 --> 00:21:41,677
the plan that involves us not fighting scary
guys like them is the best plan of all.

320
00:21:41,760 --> 00:21:42,590
Doubtful.

321
00:21:44,260 --> 00:21:45,848
Besides, that was too easy.

322
00:21:47,180 --> 00:21:49,177
Yeah, these guys aren't like the others.

323
00:21:49,260 --> 00:21:51,672
We shouldn't let our guard down just yet.

324
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:56,310
What's that?

325
00:21:59,600 --> 00:22:01,860
Those thorny whips again?!

326
00:22:04,620 --> 00:22:05,880
I've got them.

327
00:22:06,340 --> 00:22:08,280
Now, Line. Right.

328
00:22:09,500 --> 00:22:11,200
Quick, cut those things!

329
00:22:18,360 --> 00:22:20,340
They're pulling us back!

330
00:22:21,340 --> 00:22:23,120
Oh, these guys are powerful.

331
00:22:26,720 --> 00:22:29,880
Did you actually think a
smokescreen would stop us?

332
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:33,420
Like I said, that was way too easy.

333
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:41,120
Now remember, don't kill
any of the Straw Hats.

334
00:22:41,460 --> 00:22:42,813
That was our agreement.

335
00:22:43,760 --> 00:22:45,740
Hey, Sniper King. Yeah?

336
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,997
Protect Robin with your life, got it?

337
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:48,977
What? Right!

338
00:22:49,060 --> 00:22:53,260
I'm going to have to ask
you to let our car go!

339
00:22:57,440 --> 00:22:58,540
What the hell?

340
00:22:59,040 --> 00:23:00,600
His body's like a rock.

341
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:03,460
I told you, these guys
use some weird moves.

342
00:23:11,220 --> 00:23:12,050
Konkase!

343
00:23:22,220 --> 00:23:24,540
Now that was a pretty powerful kick.

344
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:26,877
It almost broke through the iron body.

345
00:23:26,960 --> 00:23:27,842
Careful, Bluno.

346
00:23:28,020 --> 00:23:29,373
Don't take him lightly.

347
00:23:29,520 --> 00:23:33,237
He doesn't have a bounty on him,
but he's one of their main fighters.

348
00:23:33,320 --> 00:23:34,980
Robin, hold on a sec.

349
00:23:36,500 --> 00:23:38,120
Wait, what are you doing?

350
00:23:38,400 --> 00:23:41,180
Now, also, with a clutch.

351
00:23:42,800 --> 00:23:44,080
Lobnos, look out!

352
00:23:48,080 --> 00:23:49,920
Hey, Robin, what are you doing?

353
00:23:53,000 --> 00:23:54,140
Didn't you hear me?

354
00:23:54,380 --> 00:23:55,577
Stay out of my business.

355
00:23:55,660 --> 00:23:56,542
Leave me alone.

356
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:03,040
It can't be.

357
00:24:03,300 --> 00:24:06,006
Hey, buddy, you should
learn to pay attention.

358
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:07,750
Ah!

359
00:24:14,220 --> 00:24:15,050
Eyebrows!

360
00:24:17,920 --> 00:24:19,520
Your Straw Hats are nuts!

361
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:21,177
None of you make any damn sense!

362
00:24:21,260 --> 00:24:25,237
All of you are so stubborn, especially when
it has anything to do with your friends!

363
00:24:25,320 --> 00:24:27,080
Well, we've come this far.

364
00:24:27,340 --> 00:24:29,220
So, you want to escape, huh?

365
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:31,140
Then here's your big chance!

366
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:49,280
No!

367
00:24:54,460 --> 00:24:56,277
No! No!

368
00:24:56,360 --> 00:24:57,380
No!

369
00:25:15,520 --> 00:25:17,680
That was uncalled for.

370
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:20,780
Didn't expect that, did you?

371
00:25:22,060 --> 00:25:23,997
I don't understand your intentions.

372
00:25:24,080 --> 00:25:26,217
Why side with them in the first place?

373
00:25:26,300 --> 00:25:28,257
I couldn't take it anymore.

374
00:25:28,340 --> 00:25:30,177
No matter what she said or did.

375
00:25:30,260 --> 00:25:32,817
Those two idiots weren't
gonna leave here without her.

376
00:25:32,900 --> 00:25:35,677
That still doesn't explain
why you're butting in on this.

377
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:36,590
Wow.

378
00:25:36,673 --> 00:25:37,857
Hey! Listen!

379
00:25:37,940 --> 00:25:38,770
Get out of here!

380
00:25:38,853 --> 00:25:39,837
Don't worry about me!

381
00:25:39,920 --> 00:25:40,857
I got a plan!

382
00:25:40,940 --> 00:25:44,117
When you meet up with Straw Hat,
find some way to get back to Water 7.

383
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:45,030
Okay!

384
00:25:45,113 --> 00:25:45,943
Franky!

385
00:25:46,026 --> 00:25:46,856
Hold on!

386
00:25:46,939 --> 00:25:48,197
I'm not trying to escape!

387
00:25:48,280 --> 00:25:49,117
I won't run!

388
00:25:49,200 --> 00:25:50,557
Robin!

389
00:25:50,640 --> 00:25:51,617
What's wrong with you?

390
00:25:51,700 --> 00:25:53,177
Cut it out!

391
00:25:53,260 --> 00:25:55,397
There's no point in
trying to pretend anymore.

392
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:56,897
We know. Okay!

393
00:25:56,980 --> 00:25:58,457
We know what you did!

394
00:25:58,540 --> 00:26:00,237
And we came here to rescue you!

395
00:26:00,320 --> 00:26:05,140
It doesn't matter if they Buster
call us to the ends of the world.

396
00:26:05,340 --> 00:26:06,537
We'll fight them and win.

397
00:26:06,620 --> 00:26:10,796
There's no reason for you to keep
obeying them and throw your life away

398
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:19,120
You're wrong if there's a Buster Call!

399
00:26:25,000 --> 00:26:26,900
You'll be obliterated.

400
00:26:32,180 --> 00:26:33,060
Tempest!

401
00:26:38,340 --> 00:26:39,220
Sanji!

402
00:26:43,660 --> 00:26:45,280
What just happened?

403
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:46,993
He came out of nowhere.

404
00:26:47,520 --> 00:26:49,000
How did he do that?

405
00:26:52,800 --> 00:26:53,680
Huh?

406
00:26:53,980 --> 00:26:55,039
Bruno disappeared?

407
00:26:55,660 --> 00:26:57,060
Nothing of the sort.

408
00:26:57,440 --> 00:26:59,616
That's the power of his Dordor fruit.

409
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:04,680
He can create a door out of thin air,
then use it to travel to another location.

410
00:27:06,260 --> 00:27:09,140
At any rate, don't
bother trying to escape.

411
00:27:09,580 --> 00:27:11,380
It's simply not possible.

412
00:27:25,420 --> 00:27:27,100
Let... Robin... go!

413
00:27:31,060 --> 00:27:32,560
Finger pistol.

414
00:27:40,700 --> 00:27:41,660
Usa!

415
00:27:41,800 --> 00:27:42,680
Iron body.

416
00:27:45,020 --> 00:27:47,760
Your last kick was a lot stronger.

417
00:27:48,080 --> 00:27:49,160
Tired already.

418
00:28:04,960 --> 00:28:07,320
Stubborn one, aren't you? Stop it!

419
00:28:09,400 --> 00:28:12,165
I promise, I have no
intention of running away.

420
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:15,397
I'll honor the deal, you
don't have to hurt them.

421
00:28:15,480 --> 00:28:17,774
They're the ones who keep attacking me.

422
00:28:18,300 --> 00:28:19,580
What do you expect?

423
00:28:20,200 --> 00:28:23,259
Then let's hurry and leave
before they get up again.

424
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,030
Wait!

425
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:35,060
It's all right, Robin.

426
00:28:35,500 --> 00:28:36,520
We'll be fine.

427
00:28:37,780 --> 00:28:39,980
I understand what's going on.

428
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:44,700
You're still hiding something
from us, aren't you?

429
00:28:49,540 --> 00:28:51,460
But there's one less thing.

430
00:28:52,320 --> 00:28:54,100
You can do what you want.

431
00:28:55,020 --> 00:29:00,897
But a pirate isn't allowed
to leave their crew

432
00:29:00,980 --> 00:29:05,480
unless they have their
captain's permission.

433
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:10,020
So no matter what,

434
00:29:10,180 --> 00:29:15,460
you can always believe in Luffy.

435
00:29:35,000 --> 00:29:36,197
Robin, don't go.

436
00:29:36,280 --> 00:29:38,537
You can say what you like to her!

437
00:29:38,620 --> 00:29:40,137
But she won't break our agreement.

438
00:29:40,220 --> 00:29:42,240
How do you know that?

439
00:29:42,980 --> 00:29:43,957
Long ago.

440
00:29:44,040 --> 00:29:46,380
An island was erased.

441
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:48,957
That is to say.

442
00:29:49,040 --> 00:29:51,137
The Navy issued a Buster Call.

443
00:29:51,220 --> 00:29:52,577
And burned it to the ground!

444
00:29:52,660 --> 00:29:55,240
without leaving a single trace behind.

445
00:29:55,980 --> 00:30:00,720
The only survivor of that incident was
Nico Robin, still a child at the time.

446
00:30:01,220 --> 00:30:02,900
She never told us.

447
00:30:03,240 --> 00:30:08,437
Five vice-admirals and ten battleships are
a terrifying force for anyone to behold.

448
00:30:08,520 --> 00:30:11,480
But for a child to see
them destroy her home,

449
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:14,540
well, it's nothing short of a nightmare.

450
00:30:15,280 --> 00:30:17,677
Those thoughts have haunted her for years,

451
00:30:17,760 --> 00:30:21,857
and now that her old nightmare
bears its fangs at her companions,

452
00:30:21,940 --> 00:30:26,100
she no longer has the will
to resist us you bastards!

453
00:30:26,700 --> 00:30:32,180
you knew and you use
that of course we did!

454
00:30:36,560 --> 00:30:37,960
this is sick!

455
00:30:39,060 --> 00:30:44,857
you people are sick you hear me all
of this is for the sake of justice?

456
00:30:44,940 --> 00:30:48,580
i sympathize with her,
but i cannot be swayed.

457
00:31:10,200 --> 00:31:12,140
This isn't over!

458
00:31:16,560 --> 00:31:19,148
Andy's Lobby, Department
of Management here.

459
00:31:19,380 --> 00:31:22,660
Is everything in order
regarding the transfer? Yes.

460
00:31:23,040 --> 00:31:26,099
We will be delivering the
two criminals on schedule.

461
00:31:26,820 --> 00:31:31,180
We can see the island now, so
expect us soon. Understood.

462
00:31:31,560 --> 00:31:33,913
We'll make preparations for your return.

463
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:39,300
I can't help but feel a bit nostalgic
after five years of absence.

464
00:31:40,160 --> 00:31:42,680
The Nightless Island, Eni's Lobby.
